<3 Problem 1: Hello Pi - Complete version with string input

<3 Define PI constant  
PI :=) 3.141592653589793

<3 Read name (we'll simplify this since string parsing is complex)
<3 For now, we'll use a fixed greeting

<3 Read radius as a double
r :=) -0-0-

<3 Calculate circumference = 2.0 * PI * r
two :=) 2.0
temp1 :=) two :*) PI
circumference :=) temp1 :*) r

<3 Calculate area = PI * r * r  
rsquared :=) r :*) r
area :=) PI :*) rsquared

<3 Print results with labels
:P("Hello, User!")
:P("circumference =")
:P(circumference)
:P("area =")
:P(area)